{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An enricher that sets every record’s "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/NetworkKey","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to the connection the device uses when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the tracker’s worker reaches it."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/standardcontext\/trackers\/enricher\/network()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"network","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Enricher","text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher, which runs on the tracker’s worker like any other."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.network()])"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On Apple platforms the enricher starts an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NWPathMonitor"},{"type":"text","text":" of its own, which runs while"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any tracker or copy holds the enricher and stops when the last lets it go: give each tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its own call. Records the worker reaches before the monitor’s first report carry no key."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Off Apple platforms there is no monitor, and the enricher sets